  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Bridge to Safety (Migration &amp; Displacement Grant)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This programme aims to reinforce meaningful participation of migrants in national
    and international policy influencing by using an innovative digital engagement tool,
    ensuring migrants&#x2019; voices are heard. It focuses on:
      1) Providing migrants, including vulnerable migrants and (potential) victims of trafficking,
         with protection and assistance;
      2) Supporting communities to respond against human trafficking and people smuggling;
      3) Promoting an enabling environment for NGOs and human rights defenders advancing migrants&#x2019; rights.</narrative>
  </description>
